    excerpt: "The sustainable office of the next decade will not be defined by individual product certifications or incremental specification improvements. It will be defined by systemic integration of circular principles, net-zero performance targets, and the genuine conviction that a healthy environment for people is inseparable from a healthy environment for the planet.",
    tags: ["future", "sustainability", "net zero", "vision"],
